#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md:1
msgid "Run the recommended test matrix"
msgstr "运行推荐测试矩阵"

#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md:3
msgid ""
"This guide preserves the complete model and deployment workflow. Use a fresh"
" output directory for every case and start every quantization run from the "
"original source checkpoint."
msgstr "本指南保留完整的模型和部署工作流。每个用例都使用新的输出目录，并且每次量化运行都从原始源 checkpoint 开始。"

#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md:5
msgid "Common setup"
msgstr "通用设置"

#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md:7
msgid ""
"Record the source model name, revision, directory integrity information, "
"FlagOS-Compressor commit, backend, device, command or recipe, inspection "
"JSON, dry-run output, and validation JSON."
msgstr ""
"记录源模型名称、修订版本、目录完整性信息、FlagOS-Compressor 提交、后端、设备、命令或 recipe、检查 JSON、空运行输出和验证 "
"JSON。"

#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md:19
msgid ""
"The source directory must be separate from the output directory. Prefer a "
"new empty output directory for each case so old shards, indexes, manifests, "
"or configuration files cannot contaminate a result."
msgstr "源目录必须与输出目录分离。建议每个用例使用新的空输出目录，以免旧分片、索引、清单或配置文件污染结果。"

