"If the source is BF16, FP16, or FP32, `No supported FP8/FP4 tensors were "
"found` is expected and the source can be used directly as the float "
"reference."
msgstr ""
"如果源是 BF16、FP16 或 FP32，`No supported FP8/FP4 tensors were found` "
"是预期结果，源模型可直接作为浮点参考。"

