msgstr "先运行空运行，然后在不带 `--dry-run` 的情况下重复同一命令。"

#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md:68
msgid "D01: W8A16 group-128"
msgstr "D01：W8A16 group-128"

#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md:83
msgid "D02: W4A16 group-32"
msgstr "D02：W4A16 group-32"

#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md:98
msgid "D03: W8A8 channel/token"
msgstr "D03：W8A8 通道/token"

#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md:112
msgid "Do not pass `--group-size` for W8A8."
msgstr "不要为 W8A8 传递 `--group-size`。"

#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md:114
msgid "D04: attention-only W8A16 channel"
msgstr "D04：仅注意力 W8A16 channel"

#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md:128
msgid ""
"W8A16 channel is valid for ordinary Linear and attention weights. It is not "
"valid for routed MoE weights."
msgstr "W8A16 channel 适用于普通 Linear 和注意力权重。它不适用于路由 MoE 权重。"

#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md:130
msgid "M01-M04: Qwen3.5 MoE"
msgstr "M01-M04：Qwen3.5 MoE"

#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md:132
msgid ""
"Qwen3.5-MoE layouts are recognized for `qwen3_5_moe`, `qwen3_5_moe_text`, "
"`Qwen3_5MoeForConditionalGeneration`, and `Qwen3_5MoeForCausalLM`. A "
"supported fused bank has logical shape `[num_experts, out_features, "
"in_features]`, with `gate_up_proj` split along the output dimension."
msgstr ""
"可识别 `qwen3_5_moe`、`qwen3_5_moe_text`、`Qwen3_5MoeForConditionalGeneration` 和 "
"`Qwen3_5MoeForCausalLM` 的 Qwen3.5-MoE 布局。受支持的融合权重组具有逻辑形状 `[num_experts, "
"out_features, in_features]`，其中 `gate_up_proj` 沿输出维度拆分。"

#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md:134
msgid "M01: routed experts W4A16"
msgstr "M01：路由专家 W4A16"

#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md:149
msgid "M02: routed experts and attention W8A16"
msgstr "M02：路由专家和注意力 W8A16"

#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md:165
msgid "M03: all recognized linear weights W8A8"
msgstr "M03：所有已识别 Linear 权重 W8A8"

#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md:179
msgid "M04: routed experts W8A8"
msgstr "M04：路由专家 W8A8"

#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md:193
msgid ""
"Fused expert gate, up, and down projections must be selected as a complete "
"unit. Unselected ordinary float weights remain unchanged; unselected source "
"low-precision weights are converted to BF16 under the default policy."
msgstr "融合专家的 gate、up 和 down 投影必须作为完整单元被选择。未选中的普通浮点权重保持不变；未选中的源低精度权重在默认策略下转换为 BF16。"

#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md:195
msgid "S01-S04: DeepSeek-class models"
msgstr "S01-S04：DeepSeek 类模型"

#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md:197
msgid ""
"DeepSeek-class models may contain MLA projections such as `wq`, `wk`, `wv`, "
"`wo`, `q_a_proj`, `q_b_proj`, `kv_a_proj_with_mqa`, `kv_b_proj`, `wq_a`, "
"`wq_b`, `wkv_a`, and `wkv_b`. Use built-in selectors to preserve fused "
"projection closure."
msgstr ""
"DeepSeek 类模型可能包含 "
"`wq`、`wk`、`wv`、`wo`、`q_a_proj`、`q_b_proj`、`kv_a_proj_with_mqa`、`kv_b_proj`、`wq_a`、`wq_b`、`wkv_a`"
" 和 `wkv_b` 等 MLA 投影。使用内置选择器以保持融合投影闭包。"

#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md:199
msgid "S01: all recognized linear weights W8A16"
msgstr "S01：所有已识别 Linear 权重 W8A16"

#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md:214
msgid "S02: routed experts W4A16"
msgstr "S02：路由专家 W4A16"

#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md:229
msgid "S03: routed experts and attention W8A16"
msgstr "S03：路由专家和注意力 W8A16"

#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md:245
msgid "S04: all recognized linear weights W8A8"
msgstr "S04：所有已识别 Linear 权重 W8A8"

#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md:259
msgid ""
"Only mark S04 as supported for a specific model variant after inspection, "
"dry-run, validation, runtime loading, and accuracy testing all pass."
msgstr "只有在检查、空运行、验证、运行时加载和准确性测试全部通过后，才将 S04 标记为支持某个特定模型变体。"

#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md:261
msgid "I01: exclude auxiliary indexer weights"
msgstr "I01：排除辅助 indexer 权重"

#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md:263
msgid "Check for indexer weights:"
msgstr "检查 indexer 权重："

#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md:270
msgid ""
"For models containing these weights, exclude them from broad attention and "
"MoE selection:"
msgstr "对于包含这些权重的模型，请将它们从宽泛的注意力和 MoE 选择中排除："

#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md:286
msgid "After the plan is verified, the same command can be run in the background:"
msgstr "计划验证后，可以在后台运行同一命令："

#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md:304
msgid ""
"The exclusion affects quantization selection only. Unselected float indexer "
"weights remain float; unselected source low-precision indexer weights follow"
" the unselected-weight policy."
msgstr "该排除只影响量化选择。未选中的浮点 indexer 权重保持浮点；未选中的源低精度 indexer 权重遵循未选中权重策略。"

#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md:306
msgid "YAML recipes"
msgstr "YAML recipes"

#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md:308
msgid "The MSE recipes remain supported:"
msgstr "MSE recipes 仍受支持："

#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md:358
msgid ""
"W8A8 recipes must omit `group_size`. CLI scalar values override recipe "
"values; CLI and recipe selectors are merged. Archive the recipe with the "
"source revision and command."
msgstr ""
"W8A8 recipes 必须省略 `group_size`。CLI 标量值会覆盖 recipe 值；CLI 和 recipe 选择器会合并。请将 "
"recipe 与源修订版本和命令一起归档。"

#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md:360
msgid "Runtime and platform testing"
msgstr "运行时和平台测试"

#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md:362
msgid ""
"BF16 conversion outputs are ordinary Hugging Face safetensors directories. "
"Quantized outputs require the target runtime to support the declared "
"`compressed-tensors` schema, model mapping, Linear and MoE kernels, and "
"hardware execution path."
msgstr ""
"BF16 转换输出是普通的 Hugging Face safetensors 目录。量化输出要求目标运行时支持声明的 `compressed-"
"tensors` schema、模型映射、Linear 和 MoE 内核以及硬件执行路径。"

#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md:364
msgid "Test each claimed target independently:"
msgstr "独立测试每个声明的目标："

