msgstr "使用匹配的 CUDA、PyTorch、驱动和运行时栈，常见为 `--backend cuda --device cuda:0`"

#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md
msgid "PPU"
msgstr "PPU"

#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md
msgid ""
"Use the backend and device identifiers registered by the PPU PyTorch "
"extension"
msgstr "使用 PPU PyTorch 扩展注册的后端和设备标识符"

#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md
msgid "Haiguang DCU"
msgstr "海光 DCU"

#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md
msgid ""
"Use the backend and device identifiers registered by the DCU PyTorch "
"extension"
msgstr "使用 DCU PyTorch 扩展注册的后端和设备标识符"

#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md:372
msgid ""
"An artifact can be generated on CPU or CUDA and copied to another platform, "
"but every target still needs independent loading, correctness, memory, and "
"performance tests. Generation success and CPU fallback do not prove "
"deployment support."
msgstr "工件可以在 CPU 或 CUDA 上生成并复制到另一个平台，但每个目标仍需要独立的加载、正确性、内存和性能测试。生成成功和 CPU 回退不能证明部署支持。"

#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md:374
msgid "Release acceptance"
msgstr "发布验收"

#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md:376
