msgstr "生成 manifest 和报告时已保留。"

#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md:384
msgid "BF16 or float reference A/B accuracy test completed."
msgstr "已完成 BF16 或浮点参考 A/B 准确性测试。"

#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md:385
msgid "Loading tested on every claimed target platform."
msgstr "已在每个声明的目标平台上测试加载。"

#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md:386
msgid "Inference framework, PyTorch, driver, and device runtime versions recorded."
msgstr "已记录推理框架、PyTorch、驱动和设备运行时版本。"

