msgstr "已确认 DeepSeek MLA 和专家选择数量。"

#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md:391
msgid "Original source and previous stable artifact retained for rollback."
msgstr "已保留原始源和先前稳定产物以便回滚。"

#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md:393
msgid "Reproducible support conclusion"
msgstr "可复现的支持结论"

#: ../../source/how-to/recommended-test-matrix.md:406
msgid ""
"This wording distinguishes artifact generation, structural validity, runtime"
" loading, kernel support, and measured quality or performance."
msgstr "此表述区分了工件生成、结构有效性、运行时加载、内核支持以及测得的质量或性能。"

